  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a6fba55abdb5c7498e1cb291b496601, type: 3}
  m_Name: Worker's Journal 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  line: '03/11/2133

    

    God I hate this place. It''s just me in here now, Everything''s automated, and Homlin doesn''t leave his office. He says he busy planning ''The Marvellous Day''.


    He''s lost his mind. 129 years is too long to live.


    I''m going to lose my mind too. I wish I could quit. Got to choose between going completely insane here or a one way ticket to the war on Zani.'
  option1:
    text: Exit
    next: {fileID: 0}
    action: 0
